cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: "Residual Agents (RA)"
abstract: >-
  Residual Agents (RA) is a self-improving AI scientist for computational
  quantum science. A planner splits a reproduction task into sub-plans,
  executors carry them out, and a critic checks every result against the
  paper; the experience gained from verified repairs is kept in planner,
  critic and residual memories. This is the code used for the RA results of
  the paper "Reimagining computational quantum research with AI scientists".
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "{{RELEASE_DATE}}"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/OmniQ-QID-Lab/OmniQ"
keywords:
  - AI scientist
  - LLM agents
  - scientific reproduction
  - computational quantum science
